  "body": "Welcome to 10 Harakeke Lane, Orewa, a brand-new, single-level home where striking architectural detail, modern comfort and easy-care living come together beautifully.\r\n\r\nThe bright open-plan kitchen, dining and living area makes an immediate impression. An impressive raked ceiling and full-height glazing enhance the natural light and sense of space, creating an inviting setting for everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe contemporary kitchen is a standout, combining warm timber cabinetry with sleek charcoal finishes, a statement stone-look splashback and excellent storage. Stylish and practical, it forms a welcoming centrepiece for the home.\r\n\r\nThree well-proportioned bedrooms are complemented by two beautifully finished bathrooms, including a master bedroom with its own ensuite. Two bedrooms open directly onto the sunny rear deck, creating a private outdoor retreat with an elevated outlook across the surrounding neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nA heat pump provides year-round comfort, while the landscaped outdoor areas have been designed for easy maintenance. With the Title and CCC already issued, this beautifully finished home is ready for its new owner.\r\n\r\nFeatures You’ll Love:\r\n\r\n• Three bedrooms and two bathrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n• Brand-new and single-level\r\n• Light-filled open-plan living with a raked ceiling and full-height glazing\r\n• Designer kitchen with warm timber cabinetry, stone-look splashback and excellent storage\r\n• Two bedrooms opening directly onto the sunny rear deck with an elevated outlook\r\n• Heat pump and easy-care landscaped outdoor areas\r\n• 10-Year Master Build Guarantee for added peace of mind\r\n• Title and CCC issued, ready for you to move in\r\n\r\nViewing Directions:\r\n\r\nEnter 251 West Hoe Heights, Orewa into your GPS. Turn left at the roundabout, enter the development when you see the Strathmill sign, then follow the directional signs to 10 Harakeke Lane.\r\n\r\nSet within Orewa’s growing Strathmill community, this stylish home is an excellent choice for first-home buyers, downsizers, couples or investors seeking modern, low-maintenance living. The future Flavell Drive connection is expected to improve access towards State Highway 1, adding further convenience to this growing location.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your viewing.",
